WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.590
Follow a single instruction from memory to the processor.

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.267
The keys provide input.

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:10.040
The processor executes an addition instruction using the ALU.

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.975
Working memory holds the operands and result.

00:00:12.975 --> 00:00:15.490
The display produces the output: 12.

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.067
Which unit performs arithmetic operations?

00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:23.705
The arithmetic logic unit performs arithmetic and logical operations.
